From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: canaan: add the k230 iomux driver

Add a pinctrl driver for the K230 IOMUX block. Each pin is one 32-bit
register at offset pin * 4. The driver selects the pin function through
pinmux and sets pull, drive strength, slew rate, input/output enable and
the schmitt trigger through generic pinconf.

Upstream-Status: Pending
